        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f0635c2-1e30-43cb-a01e-2e1f28d309c6).Image",
        "Description": "Greeting Agent Luna I have good news for you. Your next contract has you going to Haven Island Resort. The &quot;Canadian&quot; Client says the 5 you see before you are members of a group that wants to put a stop to hockey during these trying times. As the client is Canadian, I assume this one is personal. Happy Hunting Agent Luna.",
